  - Id: '0.3'
    Version: Update 0.3
    Name: Voyages
    Date: November 2026
    Line: Take your crew aboard the Ark and sail the HyperSea.
    Art: {fileID: 0}
    Features:
    - Title: Take a job
      Line: 'Your pilots bring you work: bounty hunts, couriers, raids and the Leviathan.'
    - Title: Rival crews
      Line: Black Tide and other crews take the same jobs. Get there first.
    - Title: Sagas and relics
      Line: Follow a saga to its end and bring home a relic, like the Lantern of Oriel.
    Also:
    - A new voyage HUD, the same on PC, phone and controller.
    - The Ark no longer waits at a stop forever.
    - Escort wingmates keep their target after a pilot swap.
    Button: 1
    ButtonLabel: Set sail
